            "h3": "Recommendation (draft)"
          },
          {
            "p": "Lead the $10M Series A with $6M at a $30M pre-money valuation, **subject to** the unit economics model showing a credible path to 60% gross margin per carrier within 18 months."
          },
          {
            "h4": "The business today"
          },
          {
            "ul": [
              "ARR $2.4M across 86 carriers",
              "Net revenue retention 128% on the oldest cohort, 117% blended",
              "Burn $310k a month; 14 months of runway before this round"
            ]
          },
          {
            "h4": "What the customer calls said"
          },
          {
            "p": "Eight calls, eight planned renewals. Fuel savings come up before emissions data, which means the product sells on cost even before regulation bites."
          },
          {
            "h4": "The key risk"
          },
          {
            "p": "**Margin per carrier is 41%.** Onboarding still needs a solutions engineer for three weeks per carrier. Joon is testing whether the new self-serve connector cuts that to one week; results @+2d."
          },
          {
            "h4": "What would change our mind"
          },
          {
            "ul": [
              "Connector test shows onboarding stays above two weeks",
              "Either churned carrier left over data quality rather than price"
            ]
          }
        ]
